---
title: Vadalia Onion Dip
author: Johnnie Sue Oppegard
category: Appetizers & Dips
source: Loving Memories of Mildred
---

@chopped Vadalia onions (sweet){2%cups}
@mayonnaise{2%cups}
@shredded parmesan cheese{1%cup}
@shredded swiss cheese{1%cup}

Bake for 30 minutes at 350 degrees. Serve with club crackers.
